  ('ML-NEW-024-mostrar-produto-de-perto', 'Create a realistic 8-second overhead product video using the provided image as the ONLY visual reference.

### CRITICAL PRODUCT CONSISTENCY

The exact product shown in the reference image must remain the SAME physical product throughout the entire video.

